1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,000
Welcome, everybody, to the “City at Night” tour.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:06,760
My name's Barbara, and I'll be your guide and host this evening.

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:13,860
I know that many of you know Blackburn well, but I hope that you are going to enjoy seeing a different side of this city.

4
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:17,600
First, we'll be visiting Blackburn's medieval fortress.

5
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:22,600
And I should warn you that we will be visiting the dungeons and torture chamber.

6
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,820
Then we'll go to historic Wetherby Mansion.

7
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:33,165
There are rumors that it is haunted by the ghost of Lady Wetherby, who disappeared mysteriously five hundred years ago.

8
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:44,935
And finally, to finish on a happier note, there will be a champagne supper in Blackburn Tower Park, which has a splendid view of the sparkling city lights and the surrounding hills.
